    "detailed_description": "&quot;Next Station: Zombies&quot; is an indie-casual game that throws you into a post-apocalyptic world infested with hordes of ravenous zombies. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs the last hope for humanity, you find yourself aboard a specialized train armed with powerful weaponry. Your mission is to rid the railway of the undead menace by constructing an arsenal of formidable weapons on the train car itself. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you be able to fend off the relentless onslaught of zombies and secure a safe passage to the next station?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features :<br />\r\n- Base Building and Weapon Crafting<br />\r\n- Intense Zombie Battles<br />\r\n- More than 20 levels",
